 $910.0 million. The sale was completed in three closings, with the entire cash consideration collected at the first closing and allocated to the closings on a relative fair value basis. The final closing occurred on July 1, 2023 and included the European Union operations. The gain on the sale from each closing was recognized by the Parent’s subsidiaries, and portions of the proceeds payable to the Parent’s subsidiaries were settled by means of non-cash distributions by those subsidiaries.","context":"4. Divestiture","section":"3. Related Party Transactions","block":1571,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-061340","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001365135","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1365135/000119312526061340/wu-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7.bin","sha256":"88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"3325ee012ace8efeeba3259f21ac753a23bb919964674dd27e03d5978e71e72a","quote":"The following is a summary of certain key risk factors with respect to our Company. You should read this summary together with the more detailed descriptions of risks relating to our Company below.","context":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":239,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-061340","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001365135","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1365135/000119312526061340/wu-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7.bin","sha256":"88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7"}},{"id":"b6c1119d38bbae1affe5ee438baaed9276e1923e147381c0d0c7607436c17291","quote":"Demand for our services is dependent on a number of factors that could be materially impacted by adverse changes in the global economy.","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":242,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-061340","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001365135","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1365135/000119312526061340/wu-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7.bin","sha256":"88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7"}},{"id":"0d43618d01f5e2d11818ff691bdb7c798cac2fe4b49ba75aec03abade728b8ed","quote":"We operate in highly competitive and rapidly evolving industries and face competition from a wide variety of service providers.","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":244,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-061340","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001365135","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1365135/000119312526061340/wu-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7.bin","sha256":"88b5a306884ba3d76d10766b1f35840eac6a7563ee12de2e54be86837ecc32d7"}},{"id":"a1011abf057c007a2eba357d0135f8cb61c0341e807ec63121bf7ce3789625cc","quote":"Our business depends on consumer confidence and migration patterns, which could be adversely affected by a number of factors, many of which are outside of our control.","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":246,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26